NoncePinPolicy::checkAction
├── given the config was never initialized
│   └── it should fail closed
├── given the pinned nonce is unspent on Permit2
│   ├── it should succeed
│   └── given the pin is zero
│       └── it should succeed
├── given the pinned nonce was spent on Permit2
│   ├── it should fail
│   └── given the pin is zero
│       └── it should fail
└── given a burn for another account, another nonce, another multiplexer or another config
    └── it should succeed
